OL,3,AUK faces worst decade for household
OL,4,Aincomes, IFS think tank says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK faces the "worst decade for
OL,7,Fhousehold income growth on record",
OL,8,Faccording to the head of the
OL,9,Finfluential Institute for Fiscal
OL,10,FStudies (IFS) think tank
OL,12,FIt comes after the head of government
OL,13,Fspending watchdog the Office for Budget
OL,14,FResponsibility (OBR) warned the
OL,15,Fcountry's economic outlook is a "pretty
OL,16,Fgrim picture"
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
