OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of Poundland hangs in the
OL,7,Fbalance as the discount chain edges
OL,8,Ftowards collapse, the BBC understands.
OL,10,FThe retailer's bosses filed a notice of
OL,11,Fintention to appoint administrators,
OL,12,Fwhich if approved by the High Court,
OL,13,Fwill give the business 10 days
OL,14,Fbreathing space to find a rescue deal.
OL,16,FThe move comes after Poundland's
OL,17,Fmanaging director Barry Williams wrote
OL,18,Fa memo to his 12,000 staff across its
OL,19,F600 stores in the UK and Ireland saying
OL,20,Fthe chains' US owner had limited
OL,21,FPoundland's access to funding.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
